  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sanitation and Hygiene Fund (SHF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Sanitation and Hygiene Fund (SHF) is a multi-donor pooled fund established in Geneva in 2020 with the overall mission to effectively address the sanitation, hygiene and menstrual health gap; and raise, catalyze and invest resources to accelerate the delivery of sustainable sanitation and hygiene services for people with the highest-burden and lowest ability to respond. The United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) is engaged as the Fund Manager/Trustee to administer the funds and provide services to its Fund Secretariat.</narrative>
  </description>
